{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01L7eRLVSeH9W69WhfUiQHh2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task written to `.cobbler/measure-20260223-203515.yaml`.\n\n**Summary of proposed task:**\n\n**Task 0: Implement pkg/testutils differential testing harness** (no dependencies)\n\nThis is the foundational task for the entire project. `pkg/testutils` is the acceptance gate for every utility — nothing can be verified without it. The task implements:\n\n- `DiffTest` struct and `NormalizeFunc` type\n- `RunDiffTests` — the main entry point that runs both binaries with identical inputs and compares outputs\n- Binary execution with 10-second timeout via `context.WithTimeout`\n- Byte-for-byte comparison of stdout, stderr, and exit code with detailed divergence reporting\n- `TimestampNormalizer` — needed immediately by `cmd/ts` tests (rel01.0)\n- `ComposeNormalizers` for chaining multiple normalizers\n- File-state comparison for utilities like sponge whose output is a file, not stdout\n- Unit tests using system binaries (no dependency on cmd/ implementations)\n\nEstimated ~280 lines of production code across 2 source files + 1 test file. This unblocks all downstream work: `cmd/ts` implementation, `cmd/ts` differential tests, and every subsequent utility in rel01.1+."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3589,"cache_read_input_tokens":92537,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3589},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b4246158-91ad-4b1c-975c-06af2c84ea72","uuid":"bcbc056d-17b2-43b8-8f5d-904b957af1ce"}
